WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Become the happiest base resident now

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,400
you saved our lives

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,800
My wife and I are willing

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,000
I am willing too

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,400
As long as you keep us safe

6
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:16,270
