10
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,340
We still want to go home

11
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,330
Leave if you want

12
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:36,900
repetitive meaning

13
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,770
Doesn't count as one

14
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:39,970
It's a loser

15
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:41,530
Double again

16
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:43,630
you in the future

17
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:46,310
Just call me lord, lord
